            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag the bar on top to move it and the grip at its right end to resize it. On a half-folded foldable it stays below the hinge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上端のつまみを上下にドラッグすると高さを変えられます。折りたたみ端末を折り曲げているときはヒンジの位置に固定します。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag the grip on its top edge up or down to change its height. On a half-folded foldable it stays at the hinge."
