            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Idle"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "応答がないまま時間切れになりました。リモートの電源とネットワーク、ファイアウォールで RDP（通常 3389）が許可されているかを確認してください。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection timed out with no response. Check that the remote computer is on and reachable, and that its firewall allows RDP (usually port 3389)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手元IME": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local IME"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手元IME は iPad で変換して確定した文字だけを送ります（Windows 側の IME はオフにしてください）。ホストIME は英数キーボードの打鍵をそのまま送り、Windows 側の IME で変換します。セッション中にキーバーで切り替えられます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local IME sends only text you compose and commit on this device (turn the Windows IME off). Host IME sends keystrokes from the English keyboard as they are, for the Windows IME to convert. You can switch during a session on the key bar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手元キーボード": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On-Screen PC Keyboard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
