      }
    },
    "本のように横向きで少し折ったときも、手元キーボードを画面の下に出します（左右分割の設定に従います）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Folded a little while held sideways, like a book, the PC keyboard also comes up along the bottom (split if that is on)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "標準": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
